Subject: [BioC] voom() vs. RPKM/FPKM or otherwise normalized counts,
 and GC correction,
 when fitting models to a small number of responses (per-feature counts)
In-Reply-To: <CAC2h7usMGEz8u-gXJvHMUTW+JLYr=vM5bMZWm12s4_NZ7axyLg@mail.gmail.com>
